        "content": "# Student Assistant Automation System\n\n## Purpose and structure\nThis folder contains the **Student Assistant Automation System** workflow. Its executable nodes use `code`, `discord`, `gmailTrigger`, `googleSheets`, `if`, `scheduleTrigger`. The table and connection map below are derived from the JSON, not an inferred guarantee of behavior.\n\n## Setup\nImport inactive. Configure your own credentials and replace REPLACE_WITH_* values. Review external destinations and Code nodes before running.\n\n## Entry points\nGmail Trigger, Schedule Trigger, Schedule Trigger1\n\n## Verification\nSanitized source candidate; not runtime-tested. This overview is generated from node metadata. Read the folder README for the connection map, credential types, and license.\n\n## Attribution\nhttps://github.com/nadjibdje/Student-Assistant-Automation-System/blob/c3907654055b9d0481fe4cc345da019801e3817e/main.json\nMIT; preserve source notices.",
